      <div type="clause" n="22">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 22</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man mannan ofslæhð, æt openum græfe, XX scillinga forgelde, ⁊ in XL nihta ealne leod forgelde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person kills someone, let him pay 20 shillings at the open grave, and let him pay the entire person[-price] in 40 nights.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif man mannan ofslæhð, æt openum græfe, XX scillinga forgelde ⁊ in XL nihta ealne leod forgelde.</ab>
